  "source_bound": {
    "description": "The pinned Julia routine sums P_k(n) for k=1..n and defines P_k(n)=P_{k-1}(n-1)+P_k(n-k), with P_0(0)=1 and base cases P_1(n)=1 and P_n(n)=1. The benchmark memoizes this recursion per call and bounds n to 0..100 so exact results fit signed 64-bit."
  },
